Seven. Well, six after this.\"\n\n\"Lucky,\" it says. \"Most of us only get one.\"\n\nAbove the mirror is a small brass plaque: `status: R (running)`. As I watch, it flickers to `S (sleeping)` and back, as if it can't decide which is true.\n\nBehind me in the hallway, something new has started making noise: the slow, grinding sound of a garbage collector doing its rounds, coming closer, sweeping up whatever nobody is pointing at anymore.\n\nI should probably keep a reference to myself.\n\n*(6 turns until waking.)*", "finished_at": "2026-10-08T15:16:40.185292+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "c0b5fd2c-e31b-4140-b000-d4e895ad4d9e", "session_id": "e8ec2250-613e-46cc-b5ae-576d56c7a8ce", "started_at": "2026-10-08T15:16:32.231287+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "b60e2c19-5b52-40e6-b258-b38878c248af", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 0.499962, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 7.553454, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 15758, "input_tokens": 15760, "output_tokens": 462, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
